tion (quite powerful, with a crosbow, female voice) gives me a feeling that Fatima al Fahadi could be the protagonist.<br /> <br /> Sorry to hear about your troubles with VR. I have to admit that I didn't have a chance to try VR games (and Wraith indeed looks very interesting) but I hope that both of us could enjoy those games someday.</div> </div> </div> </div>Several articles have revealed that the PC is a Banu Haqim traveling from New York to Venice to find her Sire's killer.\u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/_yBS2EZFduI?t=2m13s\" target=\"_blank\">Homo sapiens. What an inventive, invincible species. It's only a few million years since they crawled up out of the mud and learned to walk. Puny, defenceless bipeds. They've survived flood, famine and plague. They've survived cosmic wars and holocausts. And now, here they are, out among the stars, waiting to begin a new life. Ready to outsit eternity. They're indomitable. Indomitable.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/420-akatsukileader13","name":"AkatsukiLeader13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar420_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1637"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-02T19:02:15-07:00","id":1513735,"title":"","content":"Another Vampoire: the Masquerade role-playing and adventure video game. VtM : Bloodlines 2 is certainly making a good enough impression, but the setting, the metaplot, and the storyline of VtM could definitely use another WoD video or computer game. I tthink that it is clear that in regard to VtM ( and also WoD - for example MtA ) computer games of the grand strategy, empire building, and nation managment type would be complex, worthwhile, and intricate.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3254-muad-dib","name":"Muad'Dib","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3254_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2059"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-02T19:17:48-07:00","id":1513737,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Muad'Dib</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1513634-new-v-tm-video-game-announced?p=1513735#post1513735\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Another Vampoire: the Masquerade role-playing and adventure video game. VtM : Bloodlines 2 is certainly making a good enough impression, but the setting, the metaplot, and the storyline of VtM could definitely use another WoD video or computer game. I tthink that it is clear that in regard to VtM ( and also WoD - for example MtA ) computer games of the grand strategy, empire building, and nation managment type would be complex, worthwhile, and intricate.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't know, I guess this that it doesn't fit with the franchise, and I think few people are expecting anything from Bloodlines2.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","t